    "detailed_description": "This is an open-world action role-playing game. The worldview is a fictional animal civilization world. In this world, you will play a little mouse and explore mysterious or dangerous scenes such as grasslands, forests, swamps, caves, etc., and discover wonderful things. creatures, they may be enemies or friends. Customize your character, upgrade your skills and equipment, and become stronger step by step to solve the world's crises.<br><br>Game features:<br>1. Rich combos, custom moves, and weapon combination systems allow you to assemble your combat system at will.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/1651a320b47b83288fb2d4d74f2ce3b5.poster.avif?t=1705216768\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/1651a320b47b83288fb2d4d74f2ce3b5.webm?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>2: A vast world exploration mode that unlocks various hidden locations by unlocking various mobile skills and testing the player's operational level.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/8c29acadc028563fee57a067578ee4ca.poster.avif?t=1705216768\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/8c29acadc028563fee57a067578ee4ca.webm?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/8c29acadc028563fee57a067578ee4ca.mp4?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>3: Rich mount system. There are various interesting mounts in the game. Different mounts can bring different operating experiences, unlock different special locations, and even different fighting methods.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/54946c8156d2f79f7518acbfc34a21dc.poster.avif?t=1705216768\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/54946c8156d2f79f7518acbfc34a21dc.webm?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/54946c8156d2f79f7518acbfc34a21dc.mp4?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>4: Chariot assembly system, you can assemble your unique chariot by unlocking various blueprints.<br>5: Rich character customization system, with a variety of interesting and cute costumes and props waiting for you to unlock.<br>6: Unforgettable plot. You will meet various friends during the journey and experience unforgettable adventures together.",
    "about_the_game": "This is an open-world action role-playing game. The worldview is a fictional animal civilization world. In this world, you will play a little mouse and explore mysterious or dangerous scenes such as grasslands, forests, swamps, caves, etc., and discover wonderful things. creatures, they may be enemies or friends. Customize your character, upgrade your skills and equipment, and become stronger step by step to solve the world's crises.<br><br>Game features:<br>1. Rich combos, custom moves, and weapon combination systems allow you to assemble your combat system at will.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/1651a320b47b83288fb2d4d74f2ce3b5.poster.avif?t=1705216768\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/1651a320b47b83288fb2d4d74f2ce3b5.webm?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>2: A vast world exploration mode that unlocks various hidden locations by unlocking various mobile skills and testing the player's operational level.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/8c29acadc028563fee57a067578ee4ca.poster.avif?t=1705216768\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/8c29acadc028563fee57a067578ee4ca.webm?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/8c29acadc028563fee57a067578ee4ca.mp4?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>3: Rich mount system. There are various interesting mounts in the game. Different mounts can bring different operating experiences, unlock different special locations, and even different fighting methods.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/54946c8156d2f79f7518acbfc34a21dc.poster.avif?t=1705216768\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/54946c8156d2f79f7518acbfc34a21dc.webm?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774690/extras/54946c8156d2f79f7518acbfc34a21dc.mp4?t=1705216768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>4: Chariot assembly system, you can assemble your unique chariot by unlocking various blueprints.<br>5: Rich character customization system, with a variety of interesting and cute costumes and props waiting for you to unlock.<br>6: Unforgettable plot. You will meet various friends during the journey and experience unforgettable adventures together.",
